Root path proxies are the only proxy boundary.

- The browser's port-proxy URL stays root-relative even though the workbench is
  mounted below /ide. COMPOSERY_PROXY_URI remains the supported override; the
  image's VSCODE_PROXY_URI supplies the uniform default.
- domainProxy and --proxy-domain go with it. Once root path proxies are the
  supported boundary the flag can no longer proxy anything: it only rewrote the
  Ports tab at a host scheme nothing serves, and lent its name to an
  origin-trust comment describing rules of its own.

